-- HOUZQORA: give every home its own unique photos.
-- The 40 homes shared only 12 photos, so different listings looked like the same house.
-- This replaces all 3 photos of every home with 3 photos no other home uses (120 distinct
-- photos in total, each verified to load), and fixes the one duplicated title.
-- Slugs, rents, fees and all other details are untouched, so bookings and saved homes keep working.
-- Safe to run twice: the same photos and titles are set every time.

